{"title":"Career Roadmap · Field Officer (Agri Inputs)","role":"Field Officer (Agri Inputs)","summary":"A Field Officer (Agri Inputs) works directly with farmers, dealers, distributors and agricultural businesses to promote, demonstrate and support the appropriate use of seeds, fertilizers, crop-protection products, bio-inputs and other agricultural inputs.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Agricultural Science (B.Sc General)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons: 2026–2046","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build agronomy + crop science + field-sales fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2030–2032"},{"text":"Internship + farmer/dealer exposure + entry-level field role"}],[{"text":"2032–2035"},{"text":"Independent territory management"}],[{"text":"2035–2038"},{"text":"Senior Field Officer / Territory Officer"}],[{"text":"2038–2042"},{"text":"Area Manager / Technical Specialist / Product Specialist"}],[{"text":"2042–2046"},{"text":"Regional leadership, product strategy, agri-tech or entrepreneurship"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build this","Key skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Agricultural fundamentals"},{"text":"Botany, soil science, basic agronomy"},{"text":"Crop observation journal"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Crop + input knowledge"},{"text":"Crop production, fertilizers, seeds, pests"},{"text":"Crop/input comparison project"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Field operations"},{"text":"Plant protection, demonstrations, farmer communication"},{"text":"Field internship"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Commercial agriculture"},{"text":"Territory management, dealer network, Excel, reporting"},{"text":"Agri-input field project + internship"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Agricultural Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong understanding of the agricultural ecosystem."},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Agronomy"},{"text":"Soil science"},{"text":"Agricultural botany"},{"text":"Plant physiology"},{"text":"Genetics"},{"text":"Agricultural chemistry"},{"text":"Entomology fundamentals"},{"text":"Plant pathology fundamentals"},{"text":"Agricultural economics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand farming systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Kharif crops"},{"text":"Rabi crops"},{"text":"Horticultural crops"},{"text":"Irrigated agriculture"},{"text":"Rainfed agriculture"},{"text":"Organic farming"},{"text":"Integrated farming systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Start a crop observation journal"},{"type":"p","text":"For each crop record:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Crop name"},{"text":"Variety"},{"text":"Sowing date"},{"text":"Soil type"},{"text":"Irrigation"},{"text":"Fertilizer application"},{"text":"Pest/disease occurrence"},{"text":"Growth stage"},{"text":"Yield"},{"text":"Major production problems"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Proof","text":"Build a 10–15 crop field reference database."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Agricultural Inputs"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the core technical foundation for the career."},{"type":"h","text":"Seeds"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Seed quality"},{"text":"Germination"},{"text":"Seed treatment"},{"text":"Hybrid vs open-pollinated varieties"},{"text":"Variety selection"},{"text":"Seed rate"},{"text":"Plant population"},{"text":"Seed storage"},{"text":"Seed replacement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how different varieties perform under different:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Soil conditions"},{"text":"Climate conditions"},{"text":"Irrigation conditions"},{"text":"Pest pressures"},{"text":"Market requirements"}]}]},{"heading":"Fertilizers & Plant Nutrition","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Macronutrients"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nitrogen"},{"text":"Phosphorus"},{"text":"Potassium"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Secondary nutrients"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Calcium"},{"text":"Magnesium"},{"text":"Sulphur"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Micronutrients"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Zinc"},{"text":"Iron"},{"text":"Boron"},{"text":"Manganese"},{"text":"Copper"},{"text":"Molybdenum"},{"text":"Chlorine"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Soil testing"},{"text":"Nutrient deficiency symptoms"},{"text":"Fertilizer recommendations"},{"text":"Basal application"},{"text":"Top dressing"},{"text":"Foliar application"},{"text":"Fertigation"},{"text":"Integrated nutrient management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A field officer should be able to distinguish nutrient deficiency symptoms from pest and disease symptoms before recommending an intervention."}]},{"heading":"Crop Protection","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Insects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aphids"},{"text":"Whiteflies"},{"text":"Thrips"},{"text":"Caterpillars"},{"text":"Borers"},{"text":"Beetles"},{"text":"Mites"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Diseases"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fungal diseases"},{"text":"Bacterial diseases"},{"text":"Viral diseases"},{"text":"Nematode problems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Weed management"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mechanical control"},{"text":"Cultural control"},{"text":"Biological control"},{"text":"Herbicide-based control"},{"text":"Integrated weed management"}]}]},{"heading":"Integrated Pest Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn IPM rather than relying only on chemical control."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Crop Monitoring","Pest/Disease Identification","Economic Threshold","Cultural / Biological Control","Chemical Control when justified","Follow-up Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the importance of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Correct diagnosis"},{"text":"Dose compliance"},{"text":"Application timing"},{"text":"Resistance management"},{"text":"Safety"},{"text":"Pre-harvest intervals"},{"text":"Environmental impact"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Never recommend agricultural chemicals merely from a photograph or guess; field diagnosis and label/regulatory directions matter."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Field Operations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is where the degree becomes practical."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn farmer interaction"},{"type":"p","text":"You should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conduct farm visits"},{"text":"Ask diagnostic questions"},{"text":"Identify crop stages"},{"text":"Inspect symptoms"},{"text":"Collect field observations"},{"text":"Explain recommendations"},{"text":"Demonstrate products"},{"text":"Record farmer feedback"},{"text":"Follow up after application"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Practice explaining technical concepts in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Simple English"},{"text":"Local language"},{"text":"Farmer-friendly terminology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A technically strong field officer who cannot communicate with farmers will struggle."}]},{"heading":"Product Demonstration","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to conduct a proper field demonstration."},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"A company introduces a new seed variety."},{"type":"p","text":"You may need to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Select suitable farmers"},{"text":"Identify an appropriate field"},{"text":"Record baseline conditions"},{"text":"Establish demonstration protocol"},{"text":"Monitor crop growth"},{"text":"Compare results"},{"text":"Record yield"},{"text":"Document farmer feedback"},{"text":"Prepare a report"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Demonstration data"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Germination %"},{"text":"Plant population"},{"text":"Plant height"},{"text":"Disease incidence"},{"text":"Pest incidence"},{"text":"Crop duration"},{"text":"Yield"},{"text":"Input cost"},{"text":"Farmer economics"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Commercial Agriculture","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Now add the business side."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Territory management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dealer mapping"},{"text":"Distributor management"},{"text":"Farmer segmentation"},{"text":"Territory planning"},{"text":"Sales forecasting"},{"text":"Demand estimation"},{"text":"Competitor tracking"},{"text":"Product positioning"},{"text":"Farmer meetings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"CRM systems"},{"text":"WhatsApp Business"},{"text":"Digital reporting"},{"text":"Basic financial calculations"},{"text":"Sales dashboards"}]}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Seeds"},{"text":"Varieties, hybrids, seed sales and demonstrations"}],[{"text":"Fertilizers"},{"text":"Soil fertility and plant nutrition"}],[{"text":"Crop Protection"},{"text":"Pesticides and IPM"}],[{"text":"Bio-inputs"},{"text":"Biostimulants, microbial products and biologicals"}],[{"text":"Horticulture"},{"text":"Fruits, vegetables and plantation crops"}],[{"text":"Precision Agriculture"},{"text":"Sensors, drones, GIS and farm analytics"}],[{"text":"Agri-Tech"},{"text":"Digital agriculture platforms"}],[{"text":"Technical Sales"},{"text":"Product demonstrations + commercial sales"}],[{"text":"Farmer Advisory"},{"text":"Crop diagnosis and recommendations"}],[{"text":"Dealer Management"},{"text":"Distribution and channel development"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":