ed distribution"},{"text":"Farm advisory service"},{"text":"Precision agriculture consultancy"},{"text":"Drone-based farm services"},{"text":"Soil-testing service"},{"text":"Farm-management platform"},{"text":"Bio-input distribution"},{"text":"Farmer-producer support services"},{"text":"Agri-tech startup"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Field experience is particularly valuable because it exposes you to real farmer problems, purchasing behaviour and supply-chain gaps."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Field-commercial route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc. Agricultural Science","Agri-input Trainee","Field Officer","Senior Field Officer","Territory Officer / Territory Manager","Area Manager","Regional Manager","Business / Sales Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Field Officer","Technical Officer","Product Specialist","Crop Specialist","Technical Manager","Technical / Product Leadership"]},{"type":"h","text":"Agri-tech route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Field Officer","Precision Agriculture Executive","Agri-Tech Specialist","Digital Agriculture Manager","Agri-Tech Product / Operations Lead"]}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The traditional field officer may evolve from:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product-focused field representative"},{"type":"p","text":"to:"},{"type":"h","text":"Data-driven farm solutions advisor"},{"type":"p","text":"Future tools will increasingly include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI crop diagnostics"},{"text":"Satellite monitoring"},{"text":"Farm IoT"},{"text":"Drone imagery"},{"text":"Digital soil maps"},{"text":"Weather intelligence"},{"text":"Variable-rate technology"},{"text":"Automated farm records"},{"text":"Digital farmer platforms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest professionals will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Agronomy","Farmer Communication","Business","Data","Technology."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Agricultural Science"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Agronomy"},{"text":"Soil science"},{"text":"Crop production"},{"text":"Plant nutrition"},{"text":"Entomology"},{"text":"Plant pathology"},{"text":"Seed science"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Agri-inputs"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Seeds"},{"text":"Fertilizers"},{"text":"Crop protection"},{"text":"Bio-inputs"},{"text":"Product demonstrations"},{"text":"Input economics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Field Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Farmer interaction"},{"text":"Crop diagnosis"},{"text":"Field scouting"},{"text":"Demonstration trials"},{"text":"Farmer training"},{"text":"Field reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Territory management"},{"text":"Dealer management"},{"text":"Sales planning"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Excel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Remote sensing"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python basics"},{"text":"Precision agriculture"},{"text":"AI-assisted crop diagnostics"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Agricultural fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Crop + input expertise"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Field diagnosis + farmer communication"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Internship + demonstration + territory skills"}],[{"text":"0–2 years after UG"},{"text":"Field Officer / Technical Sales / Agri Extension"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Senior Field Officer / Territory Officer"}],[{"text":"5–10 years"},{"text":"Area Manager / Product Specialist"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Regional Manager / Technical Manager / Agri-Tech leadership"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate targeting Field Officer (Agri Inputs) should have:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Agricultural Science + strong crop knowledge + soil and plant nutrition + pest/disease identification + seed/fertilizer/crop-protection knowledge + farmer communication + field internship + product demonstration experience + Excel/CRM + basic GIS/precision agriculture."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest 2026-era profile is not just an agricultural sales representative; it is a technically competent field professional who can diagnose farm problems, communicate with farmers, evaluate inputs objectively, manage a territory and use digital agriculture tools to support decisions."}]}]}